{"id":"sonne-fruit","name":{"en":"Sonne Fruit","ja":"ゾンネフルーツ"},"desc":{"en":"A fruit that grew in lots of sunlight. It doesn't taste all that good, but it smells amazing. Citrus smells always make fruit seem so appetizing.","ja":"太陽の光をたっぷり浴びて育った果物。味の 方はそれ程でもないが、とにかく香りがいい。 柑橘系の爽やかな香りを嗅ぐと、食べたくな くてもついつい買って帰ってしまう。"},"level":8,"locations":[{"id":"primordial-island","name":{"en":"Primordial Island","ja":"原初の島"}},{"id":"grune-rainforest","name":{"en":"Grune Rainforest","ja":"グリューネ雨林"},"parent":"primordial-island"}],"categories":[{"id":"plant","name":{"en":"(Plant)","ja":"（植物類）"},"icon":"totori-category-plant"},{"id":"seasoning","name":{"en":"(Seasoning)","ja":"（調味料）"},"icon":"totori-category-seasoning"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"},{"id":"vegetable","name":{"en":"(Vegetable)","ja":"（食材・野菜）"},"icon":"totori-category-vegetable"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":89}